Cunha v. Freden



                      United States Court of Appeals
                         For the Second Circuit


                                   August Term 2025
                                 Argued: April 6, 2026
                                 Decided: April 28, 2026


                                     No. 25-3141-pr



                       RICARDO APARECIDO BARBOSA DA CUNHA,


