Advance Permission to Enter as a Nonimmigrant, at 6 (Jan. 20, 2025)
(“Approximate Length of Stay in the United States”). It would be
absurd for an immigration officer to ask someone like Petitioner—
who entered unlawfully and has been living here for twenty years—
to attest to his “intended length of stay.”        Section 1225(a)(5) is
therefore consistent with the notion that some, but not all, applicants
for admission are seeking admission. Just like Section 1225(b)(2)(A),
