Section 1225(b)(2)(A)—presently pursuing lawful entry into the
United States—is not undermined by any of the other statutory
provisions to which the government retreats to find support.
Therefore, we find no basis to justify departing from the
unambiguous meaning of the text, under which Petitioner is not




