IIRIRA provide further evidence that Section 1225 was not meant to
have a broader scope than Section 1226. See Reno v. Am.-Arab Anti-
Discrimination Comm., 525 U.S. 471, 483 (1999) (interpreting IIRIRA by
reference to its transitional provisions).      The enacting Congress
